<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληναῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			) <i>belonging to the wine-press</i>; esp. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> epith. of Dionysus, as <i>god of the
				wine-press</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λήναια</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά,
				<i>the Lenaea</i>, an Athenian (also Rhodian, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(1).125
			</span></i>) festival held in the month <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ληναιών</span> (i.e. Gamelion) in honour of Dionysus, at which
			there were dramatic contests, esp. of the Com. Poets, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1155
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λήναιον</span></b> , τό, <i>the Lenaeum</i>, the place at Athens where the
			Lenaea were held, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὑπὶ Ληναίῳ
			ἀγών</span> the <u>Lenaean</u> dramatic contest, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κατ᾽ ἄστυ</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				504
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				327d
			</span></i>, Lex ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διονύσια τὰ ἐπὶ Ληναίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1029.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
